{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.119998931884766,"text":"Hello, colleagues! My name is Elena Orlova. I am the General Director of Meridian. This year has become special for us. Strong teams from London and Dubai have joined us. Now we work in three countries, and each of you is an important part of the common cause. Therefore, I want to address everyone in their native language. Good afternoon, everyone! Welcome to Meridian. Whether you are in London, Dubai or Moscow, your ideas shape our future. Our doors are always open. Share your thoughts, ask questions, and let's grow together. We are one team, wherever you are.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"end":5.5,"text":" Hello, colleagues! My name is Elena Orlova. I am the General Director of Meridian.","tokens":[50364,2425,11,7734,0,1222,1315,307,39603,1610,752,2757,13,286,669,264,6996,7680,295,6124,34681,13,50652],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.45306581258773804,"compression_ratio":1.5204918384552002,"no_speech_prob":0.5008059144020081},{"id":1,"seek":0,"start":6.0,"end":12.0,"text":" This year has become special for us. Strong teams from London and Dubai have joined us.","tokens":[50652,639,1064,575,1813,2121,337,505,13,22792,5491,490,7042,293,29100,362,6869,505,13,50980],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.45306581258773804,"compression_ratio":1.5204918384552002,"no_speech_prob":0.5008059144020081},{"id":2,"seek":0,"start":12.420000076293945,"end":17.8799991607666,"text":" Now we work in three countries, and each of you is an important part of the common cause.","tokens":[50980,823,321,589,294,1045,3517,11,293,1184,295,291,307,364,1021,644,295,264,2689,3082,13,51272],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.45306581258773804,"compression_ratio":1.5204918384552002,"no_speech_prob":0.5008059144020081},{"id":3,"seek":0,"start":18.420000076293945,"end":21.940000534057617,"text":" Therefore, I want to address everyone in their native language.","tokens":[51272,7504,11,286,528,281,2985,1518,2